# UI testing

When the user invokes `/ui-test`, asks to UI-test a Xeelo site, verify User UI after publish, or sign in as a User UI account:

1. Read [ui_testing/SKILL.md](../../ui_testing/SKILL.md) and follow it.
2. Credentials: optional `userLogin` / `userPwd` in `projects/<project>/.xeelo-connection.json`. Never print `userPwd`.
3. Local username/password Sign in only. Stop on SSO/MFA.
4. Not Admin UI. Not GraphQL transfer.
5. Always end with a result **video** (`projects/<project>/ui-test/<stamp>/result.mp4`). Follow [ui_testing/report-video.md](../../ui_testing/report-video.md). Chat text is not a substitute.

Canonical docs: [docs/ui-testing.md](../../docs/ui-testing.md).
